/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:188:- 参考题目题号: 12 (6d0160f0), 2 (6aa20dc0), 6 (9caba7c3)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:189:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:190:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:191:  - operation:旋转, rotate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:192:  - object:瓦片, tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:193:  - object:缩略图, thumbnail_map
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:194:  - object:分隔线, separator_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:195:  - relation:网格分区, grid_partition
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:196:  - relation:槽位对应, slot_correspondence
