/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:227:  - operation:对称补全, symmetry_completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:228:  - operation:裁剪, crop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:229:  - object:矩形碎片, rectangular_piece
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:230:  - object:孔洞格, hole_cell
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/016.md:231:  - relation:双轴反射对称, biaxial_reflection_symmetry
