/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/029.md:137:  - object:引导像素, guide_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/029.md:138:  - object:轨迹条纹, trail_stripe
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/029.md:139:  - relation:同线对齐, colinear_alignment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/029.md:140:  - condition:位移配额传递, displacement_quota_transfer
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/029.md:141:  - condition:引导色定首动, guide_color_selects_mover
