/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/035.md:79:## 3. 接力传动机关
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/035.md:80:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/035.md:81:- 参考题目题号: `6cdd2623`, `9f8de559`, `5ffb2104`, `604001fa`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/035.md:82:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/035.md:83:  - operation:滑动, slide
