/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:177:  - relation:遮挡层序, occlusion_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:178:  - condition:可见像素定边框, visible_defines_bbox
