/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:209:  - object:前景掩码, foreground_mask
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:210:  - object:块槽位, block_slot
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:211:  - relation:掩码即印章, mask_is_stamp
