/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:214:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:215:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:216:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:217:先算上下两张掩码的异或差异图，再把这张差异图当印章，盖进它自己标出的每个槽位。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/017.md:218:
