/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:8:## 1. 微缩地址印章
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:10:- 参考题目题号：39e1d7f9、b99e7126、edb79dae
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:12:  - operation:印章覆盖, stamp
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:13:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:14:  - object:格网, lattice
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:15:  - object:指令像素, instruction_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:16:  - relation:跨尺度寻址, cross_scale_addressing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:17:  - condition:局部坐标即全局地址, local_coord_as_global_address
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:18:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:19:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:20:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:21:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:22:把每个彩色像素在其单元内的局部坐标读作全网格的单元地址，据此整格涂色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:23:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:24:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:25:- 网格被单色分隔线划分为 N×N 个单元，每个单元内部为 N×N 的像素区。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:26:- 大部分单元内部为纯背景；少数单元内部含有一个非背景、非分隔色的彩色像素。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:27:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:28:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:29:- 将每个彩色像素视为一条指令：它在所属单元内部的局部坐标 (r,c)，指向整个点阵中第 r 行第 c 列的那个单元。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:30:- 把被指向单元的内部整体涂成该像素的颜色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:31:- 所有指令执行完后，抹去原指令像素；其所在单元若未被任何指令指向，则恢复纯背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:32:- 分隔线保持不变。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:33:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:34:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:35:- 每个单元都是整幅点阵的一张微缩地图：像素的"单元内位置"不是图案，而是"单元级地址"；同一像素同时具备颜色（写什么）与位置（写到哪）两重语义。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:36:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:37:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:38:## 2. 锚段配准叠合
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:39:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:40:- 参考题目题号：2c737e39、ce4f8723、e760a62e、ed36ccf7
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:41:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:42:  - operation:锚点对齐, anchor_alignment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:43:  - operation:旋转, rotate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:44:  - operation:透明叠加, transparent_overlay
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:45:  - object:分隔行, separator_row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:46:  - object:有向锚段, directed_anchor_segment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:47:  - relation:刚体配准, rigid_registration
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:48:  - condition:重叠生成第三色, overlap_third_color
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:49:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:50:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:51:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:52:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:53:把下面板绕锚段旋转平移到与上面板锚段头尾重合后叠加，重叠处生成第三色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:54:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:55:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:56:- 一条全宽单色分隔行把网格分成上下两块等尺寸面板。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:57:- 每块面板含一个单色不对称前景图形和一条两格长的锚段：一端灰色像素（头）、一端褐色像素（尾）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:58:- 两面板前景颜色不同；下面板的图形与锚段可能整体处于被旋转过的姿态。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:59:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:60:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:61:- 输出为单块面板的尺寸，上面板保持不动。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:62:- 对下面板整体施加一个 90 度倍数的旋转加平移，使其锚段与上面板锚段完全重合，且头对头、尾对尾。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:63:- 变换后逐格合并：仅上面板为前景处取上面板颜色，仅下面板为前景处取下面板颜色，双方均为前景处涂黄色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:64:- 两条锚段不算前景，合并后不保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:65:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:66:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:67:- 灰-褐锚段是有向配准基线，不是图案的一部分；头尾两色使旋转角在四种可能中唯一确定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:68:- 部分示例中旋转角恰为 0，"纯平移对齐"是诱饵；必须先恢复姿态，再做带混合色的并集。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:69:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:70:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:71:## 3. 字形程序路由
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:72:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:73:- 参考题目题号：0e671a1a、b2bc3ffd、ed36ccf7、ac3e2b04
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:74:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:75:  - operation:连线, path_trace
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:76:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:77:  - object:格网, lattice
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:78:  - object:方向字形, direction_glyph
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:79:  - relation:指令链, instruction_chain
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:80:  - condition:臂长即步数, arm_length_as_step
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:81:  - condition:干扰字形, decoy_glyph
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:82:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:83:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:84:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:85:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:86:从红色起点字形开始，按每个字形的朝向与臂长逐段跳跃，涂出整条执行路径。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:87:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:88:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:89:- 单色分隔线把网格划分为若干单元。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:90:- 一个单元含红色字形（起点指令），一个单元内部整格为绿色（终点）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:91:- 若干单元含同族青色字形：一段直臂加在直臂一端侧面的一个偏头像素；其余单元为空。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:92:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:93:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:94:- 每个字形编码一条指令：方向为从臂的尾端指向偏头端所沿的直线方向，步数等于直臂的长度（不含偏头像素）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:95:- 从红色字形起执行：按方向在单元网格上跳过对应步数的单元，途中经过的空单元内部整格涂黄。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:96:- 落点单元含下一条青色字形则继续执行；落点为绿色单元则停止。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:97:- 未被路径访问的字形是干扰项，原样保留，不参与路径。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:98:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:99:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:100:- 字形不是要移动或复制的对象，而是"方向+距离"的复合指令：朝向由偏头像素决定，距离由臂长决定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:101:- 画面是一段以红为入口、绿为出口的程序，必须逐条执行而非做整体几何变换；不在链上的字形一概无效。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:102:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:103:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:104:## 4. 图例环与最近分区
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:105:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:106:- 参考题目题号：ac0c2ac3、df978a02、edb79dae、e760a62e
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:107:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:108:  - operation:生长, grow
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:109:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:110:  - object:种子像素, seed_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:111:  - object:颜色图例, color_legend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:112:  - relation:最近者分区, nearest_partition
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:113:  - condition:切比雪夫距离, chebyshev_distance
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:114:  - condition:等距留缝, tie_gap
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:115:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:116:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:117:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:118:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:119:以两枚种子为中心，在各自最近分区内按图例序列逐环上色，等距处留缝。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:120:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:121:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:122:- 主画布为背景色，含两个不同颜色的孤立种子像素。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:123:- 画布右侧隔一条分隔列有一竖直图例条，自上而下列出若干颜色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:124:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:125:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:126:- 对画布每个背景像素，计算它到两枚种子的切比雪夫距离，归属距离更近的种子。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:127:- 归属某种子且距离为 d 的像素，涂成图例自上而下第 d 个颜色；种子自身 d=0 保持原色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:128:- 距离超过图例长度的像素保持背景；到两枚种子距离相等的像素保持背景，形成分界缝。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:129:- 输出仅保留主画布区域，去掉分隔列与图例条。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:131:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:132:- 环不是各自画满整幅再互相覆盖：每个像素先按"最近者得"划归领地，环只在领地内生长。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:133:- 图例是"距离→颜色"的有序调色带而非对象；分界缝是双方并列僵持留下的痕迹。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:134:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:135:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:136:## 5. 推力传递链
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:137:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:138:- 参考题目题号：b2bc3ffd、df978a02、c9f8e694
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:139:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:140:  - operation:平移, translate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:141:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:142:  - object:推杆, pusher_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:143:  - object:滑块, slider_segment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:144:  - relation:碰撞传递, collision_transfer
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:145:  - condition:动量等于长度, momentum_equals_length
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:146:  - condition:逐格消耗, per_cell_consumption
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:148:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:149:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:150:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:151:左端红色推杆携带等于自身长度的动量，沿行向右逐格消耗、逢撞完全转移，推出一条碰撞链。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:152:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:153:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:154:- 黑背景网格；若干行各含一个贴左边缘的红色水平条（推杆）和其右侧若干互不相邻的单色水平段（滑块）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:155:- 各行互相独立，推杆长度与滑块布局逐行不同；其余行为空。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:157:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:158:- 每行独立处理，推杆动量等于其长度。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:159:- 最靠近推杆的滑块开始向右滑动，每前进一格消耗一点动量。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:160:- 若在动量耗尽前贴上下一个滑块，则立即停下并把剩余动量全部转交给该滑块，该滑块继续向右滑动，依此传递。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:161:- 动量耗尽时整条链终止，其后滑块不动；滑块贴上右边缘时停下且剩余动量湮灭。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:162:- 推杆保持原位不动。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:163:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:164:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:165:- 滑块不是各自按固定规则位移："每块移动自身长度的距离"与"全部向右压紧"都是会被部分示例证伪的诱饵。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:166:- 全行只有一份守恒的动量在碰撞链中传递，每块的实际位移由推杆长度与沿途空隙分布共同决定，必须理解消耗与转移的先后次序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:167:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/050.md:168:
