/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:144:## 5. 点火连锁的射线阵
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:145:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:146:- 参考题目: 18 (5c0a986e 定向射线), 7 (99fa7670 射线延伸), 16 (b775ac94 贴附像素定行为), 1 (48d8fb45 灰色指示)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:147:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:148:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:149:  - object:指示像素, indicator_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:150:  - object:孤立像素, isolated_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:151:  - relation:连锁触发, chain_trigger
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:152:  - relation:邻接, adjacency
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/009.md:153:  - condition:命中主体才点燃, hit_body_to_ignite
