/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/001.md:51:  - object:周期瓦片, periodic_tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/001.md:52:  - object:破缺像素, deviant_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/001.md:53:  - relation:商空间映射, quotient_space_mapping
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/001.md:54:  - condition:破缺色属图案调色板, deviant_color_in_palette
