/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:85:## 3. 尘埃调色环
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:86:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:87:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:88:  - operation:同心层填充, concentric_fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:89:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:90:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:91:  - object:空心矩形框, hollow_rect_frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:92:  - object:噪声像素, noise_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:93:  - relation:距离决定层序, distance_determines_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:94:  - condition:数量决定层厚, count_determines_thickness
