/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:124:  - object:孔洞, hole
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:125:  - object:边界锚点, border_anchor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/021.md:126:  - object:标记像素, marker_pixel
