/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/026.md:170:  - relation:标记点偏移对应, marker_offset_correspondence
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/026.md:171:  - condition:欧氏对齐矛盾, euclidean_alignment_conflict
