/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/051.md:48:  - object:多连块碎片, polyomino_fragment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/051.md:49:  - object:空心矩形框, rect_frame
