/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/014.md:89:  - object:隐藏精灵, hidden_sprite
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/014.md:90:  - relation:偏离即对象, deviation_is_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/014.md:91:  - condition:颜色不可区分, color_indistinguishable
