/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:8:## 1. 位移沿碰撞链传递
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:11:  - operation:滑动, sliding
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:12:  - operation:碰撞传递, collision_transfer
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:13:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:14:  - object:尾部向量, tail_vector
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:15:  - relation:位移守恒接力, displacement_conservation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:16:  - condition:碰撞即转交额度, collision_relays_budget
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:17:- 参考题目: 9 (c6e1b8da), 20 (11dc524f), 13 (fc10701f)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:18:- 难度评审: 达标
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:20:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:22:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:23:带尾巴的矩形沿尾向滑动，剩余位移在每次碰撞时传递给被撞矩形，像牛顿摆一样沿队列接力。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:25:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:26:- 黑色背景上，同一条直线（行或列）上排列若干互不相同颜色的实心矩形，矩形之间留有大小
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:27:  不等的空隙。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:28:- 恰有一个矩形带一条一格粗、长度至少为二的直尾巴，尾巴方向与队列方向共线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:29:- 其余矩形不带尾巴；所有位移过程保证不出界。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:30:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:31:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:32:- 擦除尾巴，带尾矩形获得等于尾长的位移额度，沿尾巴指向的方向滑动。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:33:- 矩形滑动时每前进一格消耗一点额度；若额度未耗尽就贴上前方矩形，则立刻停下，把剩余
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:34:  额度全部转交给被撞矩形，被撞矩形沿同方向继续滑动。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:35:- 传递逐个进行，直到某个矩形把额度耗尽为止；输出画出所有矩形的最终位置，不再画尾巴。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:36:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:37:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:38:- 尾长不是某一个矩形的位移，而是整条队列共享的总位移预算；每段空隙吃掉多少额度，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:39:  决定了链条在哪一环停下。只看第一对矩形会误以为尾巴仅驱动带尾者本身。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:40:```
