/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:42:## 2. 视线交点重建隐形锚块
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:43:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:44:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:45:  - operation:压缩, compress
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:46:  - operation:反演重建, inverse_reconstruction
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:47:  - object:锚块, anchor_block
