/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:113:## 4. 颜色海关走廊
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:115:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/056.md:116:  - operation:滑动, slide
