/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/049.md:40:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/049.md:41:  - object:孤立像素, isolated_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/049.md:42:  - object:虚拟路径, virtual_path
