/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:87:  - relation:图层优先级, layer_priority
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:88:  - relation:颜色指针链, color_pointer_chain
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:89:  - condition:链序即层序, chain_order_as_depth
