/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:91:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:92:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:93:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:94:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:95:读出藏在孔洞里的颜色指针，把四个面板形状按指针链的顺序叠加成一个面板。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:96:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:97:输入结构:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:98:- 输入是共享黑色背景的 2x2 等大面板阵列。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:99:- 每个面板含一个独有颜色的 4 连通形状，形状内部有封闭黑洞；叠放到
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:100:  同一面板坐标时四个形状两两存在重叠。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:101:- 恰有三个形状的某个孔洞中藏着一枚单像素：它的颜色等于另一个面板
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:102:  形状的颜色。三枚指针把四个形状连成一条无分叉的链，链尾的形状孔
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:103:  中没有指针。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:104:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:105:规则:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:106:- 建立与单个面板同尺寸的输出画布。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:107:- 从没有被任何指针指到的形状（链头）开始，沿指针链依次绘制四个形
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:108:  状：只画形状本体的非背景像素，孔内的指针像素不绘制，后画的覆盖
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:109:  先画的。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:110:- 面板方位、颜色编号与孔洞数量都不参与排序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:111:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:112:关键洞察:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:113:- 覆盖顺序既不写在面板位置上也不写在颜色号上，而是藏在孔洞内部的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:114:  指针像素里：孔里的杂点其实是"下一层是谁"的颜色引用，整条链读通
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:115:  之后层序才成立，漏读或误读任何一枚指针都会得到错误的遮挡关系。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:116:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:117:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:118:## 4. 连通写在墙缝里的区域迷宫
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:119:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:120:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:121:  - operation:寻路, pathfinding
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:122:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:123:  - object:分隔线, separator_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:124:  - object:单色区域, uniform_region
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:125:  - object:缺口像素, gap_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:126:  - relation:网格分区, grid_partition
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:127:  - relation:尺度提升, scale_lift
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:128:  - condition:缺口定义邻接, gap_defines_adjacency
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/047.md:129:  - condition:同色链诱饵, same_color_chain_decoy
