/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:7:## 1. 端口链式点亮
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:8:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:9:- 参考题目题号: 5, 10, 12, 15
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:11:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:12:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:13:  - object:空心矩形, hollow_rect
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:14:  - object:开口, opening
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:15:  - object:标记像素, marker_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:16:  - relation:端口对齐, port_alignment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:17:  - condition:链式激活, chain_activation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:18:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:19:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:20:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:21:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:22:从含火种的空心框出发，沿开口方向逐段传递激活，点亮所有被链式接通的空心框。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:23:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:24:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:25:- 黑色背景上分布若干互不相触的单色空心矩形框，每个框的墙上恰有一个一格宽的开口。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:26:- 恰有一个框的内部含一个黄色火种像素，其余框内部为空。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:27:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:28:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:29:- 含火种的框首先被激活；被激活的框从其开口沿开口的外法线方向射出一条直线射线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:30:- 射线一路穿过背景：若首先触及某框的墙体则就地终止；若恰好从某框的开口进入该框，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:31:  则该框被激活，并继续由它自己的开口射出新的射线，如此传递。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:32:- 输出中，所有被激活的框内部以黄色填满，射线经过的背景格画为黄色；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:33:  未被激活的框保持原样，火种像素保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:34:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:35:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:36:- 开口是有方向的端口，激活沿"射线恰好命中开口"的关系形成一条链；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:37:  与火种框对齐但被别的墙体挡住的框不会点亮，要判断的是端口可达性而非几何对齐。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:38:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:39:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:40:## 2. 多中心残墙的归属补全与嵌套染色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:41:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:42:- 参考题目题号: 1, 5, 11
