/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:44:  - operation:对称补全, symmetry_completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:45:  - operation:洪泛填充, flood_fill
