/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:162:  - operation:逻辑异或, logical_XOR
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:163:  - object:控制像素, control_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:164:  - object:闸门像素, gate_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:165:  - relation:行列对齐, row_col_alignment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:166:  - condition:同色切换开关, same_color_toggles_state
