/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:227:## 7. 套娃钥匙的连锁装配
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:228:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:229:- 参考题目题号: 8, 11, 12, 13
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:230:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:231:  - operation:形状匹配, shape_matching
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:232:  - operation:移动, move
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:233:  - operation:拼接, merge
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/023.md:234:  - object:精灵体, sprite
