/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/020.md:43:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/020.md:44:  - object:同心环色表, concentric_ring_legend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/020.md:45:  - object:空心框, hollow_frame
