/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/044.md:113:## 4. 看不见的对角线对决
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/044.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/044.md:115:- tags:
