/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/044.md:122:  - condition:奇偶决定有无整格交点, parity_gates_intersection
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/8/044.md:123:  - condition:等长平局特判, tie_special_case
